# Set to "true" to enable the sign-in gate and the backend-backed store
# instead of the local/in-memory one (see client/src/api/{auth,store}.js).
# Leave unset for local frontend-only dev — no server or database needed.
#
# Requests always go to relative /api/* paths — in production the built
# client is served by the same Node process as the API (server/src/index.js),
# and in local dev Vite's own proxy (vite.config.js) forwards /api/* to a
# server you run separately with `npm run dev -w server`.
VITE_USE_API=
